    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061113.0432\n\nSHENYANG, Nov. 14 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nURGENT: Colliery flood traps 8 in northeast China\n\n\n\n\nEight people were trapped when a colliery was flooded in northeast China's Liaoning Province, the local government confirmed Tuesday.\n\nThe accident was reported at the Dahenan Colliery in Huazi Township in Dengta, a city about 50 kilometers south of the provincial capital Shenyang.\n\nA spokesman of the provincial work safety administration said reports of the flood were received at 11:30 a.m. and it was not clear whether the victims were still alive.\n\nHe did not give the exact time of the accident.\n\nRescue work is underway and a team of reporters from Xinhua's Liaoning provincial bureau are on their way to the site.",
